```text
READ_PATIENT
READ_OBSERVATION
READ_CONDITION
READ_DOCUMENT
READ_MEDICATION
```

---

## Schreibrechte

```text
WRITE_OBSERVATION
WRITE_DOCUMENT
WRITE_MEDICATION
```

---

## Systemrechte

```text
