LOCAL_STORAGE
NOTIFICATION_ACCESS
CAMERA_ACCESS
```

---

## KI Rechte

```text
AI_LOCAL_MODEL
AI_REMOTE_PROVIDER
AI_RAG
AI_EMBEDDING
