## Ziel

Lose Kopplung aller Komponenten.

---

## Standard Events

```text
FHIR_CREATED
FHIR_UPDATED
FHIR_DELETED

CONSENT_GRANTED
CONSENT_REVOKED

PLUGIN_INSTALLED
PLUGIN_REMOVED

